#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""labctl: a hermetic El Tor regtest test network on one Linux host or VM.

Everything listens on loopback: bitcoind (regtest), one Core Lightning node per foundation relay plus a
payer and a routing hub, an el-tor Chutney network (directory authorities, foundation relays, a
foundation client) and a checksummed HTTP origin. Real regtest Lightning settles every paid round, so
positive-price circuits, renewal, payment stop and recovery can be exercised without real funds.

Stdlib only. State lives under $ELTOR_LAB_STATE (default /lab); see testnet/README.md.
"""
